WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.900
I shall now garner
human respect through fear!

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.280
You idiot! You don't get it at all!

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.030
I think I'm being followed.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.170
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:21.170
Help me! Help me! Help me...!

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:54.830
Igarashi-san?

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:02.830
Please... help... me...

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.950
CHAPTER 5

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:18.350
THE DISASTER OF THE ELECTRIC <i>YOKAI</i>

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:23.430
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.890
NOTICE OF CLOSURE

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.930
Here. Eat up.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.510
No home, no money, no future.
We've both got pathetic lives.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:36.910
Eat up, brother. No need to be modest.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:41.410
Hey, hey, hey!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:45.080
Y-Y-You bastard! Stop!

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.840
This is my best suit...

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.010
How?

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:57.910
Sink him at sea or bury him
in the mountains. It doesn't matter.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:03:59.330
Just do it.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.330
M-Mister Ameyama?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.390
What?

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:07.170
That guy you're sinking or burying,
how much has he skipped out on?

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:08.960
Ten million.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.960
That's unforgivable!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:15.640
By the way, I only owe... one million yen.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.530
-I'm no monster.
-Thank gosh!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.060
It's just a million, so,

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:24.500
you can choose whether to be pushed
or whether to jump yourself.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.750
Wh-What?!

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.790
H-H-Help m-me!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:46.220
K-Kami-sama!

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.310
What is that?!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.540
What's going on?!

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.060
Ow, ow, ow...

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:10.110
Falling towards the sky. How about that?

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.300
Huh?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:21.720
KAMINARI

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:25.830
I-It's Kaminari-sama! Help!

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.540
Ameyama-san, are you okay?

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.710
Of course not! That's a monster!

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:33.860
Personally, you humans are much scarier...

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:36.030
You there, <i>yokai</i>.

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.760
You're the one who called me, correct?

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:41.280
No, no, I didn't call... Oh!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.740
K-Kami-sama!

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:49.000
I was asking for god. I said, "Kami-sama,"
not "Kaminari-sama."

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:05.470
Honestly. One bang from my drum

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:08.920
and people used to run
crying that I'd take their bellybuttons.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:13.520
Now, they all act like I don't even exist.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.550
I'm called for the first time in a while,
so I show up in high spirits and...

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.200
Hey! Where are you going?!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.940
I'm still talking here!

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:33.110
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold it, hold it!

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:37.110
Move, puny <i>yokai</i>.
Mock me and you'll regret it!

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.360
Mock you?! I would never!

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:43.580
Considering that power of yours,
I'd like to talk business.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:44.720
Biz-ness?

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:49.120
Hey, Ratty, what are you talking about?!

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:52.930
Town revitalization... And...!

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:57.260
Hey, Kitaro, aren't you concerned at all?

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.820
About what?

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:00.720
About Rat Man.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:04.120
Come to think of it,
I haven't seen him recently.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.570
BIBIBI ELECTRIC COMPANY

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:17.210
Let's hope he's not up to no good again.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.370
Check.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:27.040
I'm too distracted
thinking about Rat Man to focus.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.660
That's enough for today.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.210
Hey, Kitaro!

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.880
No fair!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.650
Things are looking good, mayor.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.800
Thanks to you.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:44.760
Exactly! Or so I'd like to say.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:48.730
But, it's all thanks to that power plant.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:57.650
We sell the electricity
that Kaminari makes to humans for cheap...

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.830
We lure factories and businesses
to this town...

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:08.120
And then, Mister Ameyama,
you switch jobs from mob boss to mayor...

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.630
Then we cook the books...

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:15.550
It's the perfect money-making system.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:20.140
Damn. Not again.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.840
KAMINARI

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.320
Yes, yes. I-I'll be right there.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.950
Sensei, you rang?

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:35.900
You're late. When I call,
come in three minutes.

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:38.840
I-I'm very sorry, sensei!

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.700
So, what did you want?

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:48.970
L-Look.

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:54.630
Take a look at BiBiBi Electric Company's
mascot character, Kaminari-sama!

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:50.040
KAMINARI-SAMA SOUVENIRS

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.420
BIBIBI ELECTRIC COMPANY MASCOT
KAMINARI-SAMA

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:57.460
The electricity's cheap...

00:08:55.540 --> 00:09:00.300
<i>"Kaminari-sama is booming?!"</i>

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.130
Lots of people come...

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:03.850
Business is booming...
It's all thanks to Kaminari-sama!

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:05.130
<i>"What are some reactions
from passerbys?"</i>

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:10.190
The savior of this town
is loved by all the residents.

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:12.140
MASCOT CHARACTER SPECIAL

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.450
Isn't it cute?

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.830
Cute?!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:20.490
See that? See how much
the humans respect me?!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>What a pain.</i>

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:31.030
<i>Well, as a result,
he's working 24-7 for no pay,</i>

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.450
<i>so it'd be blasphemous to complain.</i>

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.510
Hey, Rat Man.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.540
Yes, sensei!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.310
-Let me meet this woman.
-Huh?

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.300
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:47.630
If people learn their cheap
electricity source is <i>yokai</i> secretion,

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.570
our company would go under!

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:55.640
Then I won't make electricity anymore!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:59.420
I'll set it up for you. Happy?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:06.200
Today, the popular Kaminari-sama
has come to visit us in the studio!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.660
<i>Please... You're supposed to be
a guy in a suit.</i>

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:12.410
You look like the real Kaminari-sama!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:15.420
Indeed. I am real.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:18.170
U-Uh...

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:20.000
Listen, woman.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.790
I shall make you my wife.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.820
Okay, cut! That's it!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:27.970
S-Sorry about that!
The guy inside's a new part-timer.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.990
He hasn't really gotten
the hang of his character.

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:33.350
What was that?!

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:35.860
A trick! Just a little performa--

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:10.350
Hey, Ratty. Look at this.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:15.660
It's about the bribes we paid off the city
council with. We could be in trouble.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.600
THE DARK UNDERBELLY OF M CITY ELECTRICITY

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:20.640
Give me a break. I'm exhausted from
kissing up to Daddy Big-Drums.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:23.560
We've got the BiBiBi Electric Company
Festival this weekend.

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:27.360
<i>It's just sleep chills
I let my tummy hang out</i>

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:32.370
<i>So I got cold, baby</i>

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:35.680
What a pain!

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.640
BRIBERY, TAX EVASION

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:41.840
AUTHOR, YURIKO IGARASHI

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:02.870
Hello, police? I think I'm being followed.

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:06.360
<i>Where are you? We'll be right th--</i>

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:12.930
Who's there? Show yourself!

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:36.700
Help me! Help me! Help me...!

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:55.180
<i>YOKAI</i> OF KAMINARI

00:12:56.030 --> 00:13:00.040
PLAYING <i>SHOGI</i> WITH EVERYBODY

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:58.620
<i>"-No, no."
"-Oh, what should I do?"</i>

00:12:58.740 --> 00:12:59.620
<i>"Look me in the eye and tell me."</i>

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:04.880
How many times do I have to tell you?!
Make the lights more flashy!

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:08.130
Problem solved.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:09.500
DEATH BY ELECTRIC SHOCK?!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:09.800
Huh?!

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:13.110
What did you go and do that for?!

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:16.780
The culprit's a <i>yokai</i>. No one'll know.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:20.470
You idiot! You don't get it at all!

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:24.820
There's a guy who always gets involved
with incidents like this...!

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.810
Let's go, Kitaro!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:29.250
Yes, Dad!

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:31.120
I refuse!

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:34.650
Sensei, if you go down
this business is done for!

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:37.180
Please, just until things blow over!

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:41.450
I don't know how strong
this Kitaro kid is,

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.140
but who do you think I am?!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:51.390
I'm Kaminari-sama!
No, I'm god, I'm Kami-sama!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:05.030
I'll show you a real festival!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:10.360
T-Trying to control an unpredictable guy
like this was impossible from the start...

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:18.550
There it is!

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:22.810
All of you, fear me and worship me more!

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:23.810
Here it comes!

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:29.230
A whoop! And a whoop!

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:30.920
We can't get close like this!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.250
Rollo Cloth!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.780
Hold tight!

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:37.490
Here we go!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.610
How insolent!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.220
Ouch!

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:46.830
I got burned!

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:59.450
It looks like this place
has its own gravity.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:02.790
That's what saved you.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:14.390
You're the one who killed
the magazine reporter, right?!

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.430
Indeed I am!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.700
Hair Needles!

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.710
It's not working!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.130
Chanchanko!

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.500
Nimble little brat.

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:42.430
How about this?!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.420
What?!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:55.730
I control the gravity of
this place as I please!

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:01.770
My body's getting crushed...

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:13.040
Had enough, boy?!

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:15.710
N-Not yet!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:20.400
Stubborn little brat.

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:25.470
Have a good taste of the electricity
I've saved up in my drums!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.550
This will end it!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.360
That's enough of that!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.990
Old Man Crybaby!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.390
What nonsense is this?!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:56.660
I'm solid as a rock!

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:59.040
Well done!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:05.000
How's that? Old Man Crybaby's heavy
when he's stone, isn't he?

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:11.160
Are you all right, Kitaro?!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.520
Somehow.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:16.130
Kitaro-san, did ya beat Kaminari?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:17.790
Not yet...

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.050
Then ya better hurry!

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.530
-Yeah!
-Wait!

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:26.050
We can't win like this.
We need a little preparation.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:26.990
What?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:36.100
I can't be beaten by such an old man.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.860
Wh-Where's Kitaro?

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.750
He probably ran off terrified.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:46.870
All right. Gather the humans
and we'll begin the recital.

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:52.890
Look around you!
Who's going to come hear you sing now?!

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:55.830
See? They're coming!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.840
That's different!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:07.430
This is why I was against relying on some
suspicious electricity from the start!

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:09.780
-You were grateful!
-Ouch!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:13.720
Dad, how's this?

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:15.230
Good job.

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:18.230
But, what is this?

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.030
Give me your ear.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.220
A-A monster!

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.840
I show kindness
and this is how you repay me?!

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.260
That does it!

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:51.910
I shall now garner
human respect through fear!

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:56.390
And to start with, I'll make
an example by destroying this town!

00:18:56.390 --> 00:18:59.060
<i>Oh crap. I better get out of here...</i>

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:02.160
So you were pulling the strings.

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.300
Crap!

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.740
Oh, dammit!

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:14.560
Sensei, please take care of him!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.680
Ouch!

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:21.120
Boy, you've come to be defeated again?

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:23.920
No. I've come

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:25.890
to defeat you!

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:28.970
Try it...

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.690
if you can!

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:47.170
It's over.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.330
No more banging drums for you!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.690
Wh-What is that power?!

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:06.820
It's called the power of electricity!

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:12.330
Using your electricity,
Kitaro's become a powerful electromagnet.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:15.240
Ch-Cheeky little whelp!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:16.910
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:20:19.270 --> 00:20:22.750
Curse you!

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:28.500
I'll pour electricity directly into you!

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:39.390
You're not the only one

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:43.420
who can do electric attacks!

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:44.850
What?!

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:50.030
He's draining my electricity?!

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.270
Here's a retaliatory

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:55.560
Internal Electricity!

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.250
Police.

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:12.080
We're here about your tax evasion
and the destruction of the power plant.

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:15.910
Old Man Crybaby.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:16.990
You were a real help.

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:19.000
It was nothing.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.580
As they say, easy come, easy go.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:29.850
If you've learned your lesson,
you should change your ways and... Huh?

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:33.270
That Rat Man.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:41.240
<i>Bi, bi, bibibi no bi</i>

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.180
BEWARE OF TELEPHONE FRAUD

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:47.670
S-Sorry, Kitaro! I'll be good I...

00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:55.720
You again?!

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:04.590
K-Kami-sama is so cruel.

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.460
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.460
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:08.830
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:08.830
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.500
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.500
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.390
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.390
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.970
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.970
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:30.230
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:30.230
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:35.030
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:35.030
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:43.620
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:43.620
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.540
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.540
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.800
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.800
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:01.720
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:01.720
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:09.190
<i>Dad, a letter came in the Yokai Mailbox.</i>

00:23:09.310 --> 00:23:11.980
<i>Apparently, a woman is being</i>
<i>haunted by a </i>yokai<i>.</i>

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:14.690
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

